<title>INDONESIA: TENNIS-ITALY BEAT INDONESIA 5-0 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALY BEAT INDONESIA 5-0 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy completed a 5-0 win over Indonesia in their Fed Cup world group play-off on Sunday after winning both reverse singles and the doubles.</p>
<p>Results (Italian names first):</p>
<p>Silvia Farina beat Wynne Prakusya 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Flora Perfetti beat Wurikasih Sawondari 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Francesca Lubiani/Gloria Pizzichini beat Enny Sulistyowati/Liza Andriyani 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Farina beat Sawondari 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Perfetti beat Prakusya 6-3 6-7 (6-8) 6-1</p>
</text>
